  <jpcrp030000-asr_E01940-000:NotesRegardingAccountsReceivableAndAccountsPayableToAffiliatedCompaniesTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-indent:9pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;※２　関係会社に対する金銭債権&lt;/p&gt;
